# Welfare Avenue: the Hub's Netlify headers (deployed by host-sync from site_files path _headers; source build/site/_headers).
# The security headers apply everywhere. The Content-Security-Policy is set per path, never twice on one path: the Hub and
# the form pages keep the strict policy, and the donation page (/give, wave161b) also allows Stripe's embedded form
# (Stripe's documented hosts for Checkout, Stripe.js and Link). Since wave161c the donation page may be framed by
# welfareavenue.com, www and the new site's preview address (the popup, give/embed.js and give/embed.css);
# X-Frame-Options DENY stays on the Hub, the form pages, the volunteer account page (/me, wave175) and the volunteer confirm page (/c/*, wave169a: the Hub's strict
# policy; the page itself sets no-referrer so the personal link never leaks; wave182 lets it read the serving day's forecast from api.open-meteo.com, no key, nothing personal sent) only.
# wave204 (04/10/26): the Hub page (/ and /index.html) also allows media from blob: URLs, so the email studio can read a video
# the writer picks on their own computer to make a moving preview (the file is never uploaded; only the preview is).
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), geolocation=(), microphone=(self)
/
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; media-src 'self' blob:; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src https://fonts.gstatic.com data:; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://zwnmulmnvopclzcvytce.supabase.co; connect-src 'self' https://zwnmulmnvopclzcvytce.supabase.co wss://zwnmulmnvopclzcvytce.supabase.co https://www.googleapis.com; frame-src 'self' https://www.loom.com https://www.youtube-nocookie.com https://player.vimeo.com https://docs.google.com https://drive.google.com https://zwnmulmnvopclzcvytce.supabase.co; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'
